    LLM: 'Remember the special ranking in trumps - the 5 and 9 are the most powerful cards. Try to win early tricks to gain the lead.\n\nUse reneging opportunities wisely. Save your 5 and 9 of trumps for critical tricks. Pay attention to which cards have been played.\n\nCard counting is essential. Track the trumps that have been played to know when your 5 or 9 will be unbeatable. Understand the complex reneging rules to exploit them.',
